      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.61,
      "end_seconds": 363.57,
      "duration_seconds": 28.96,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an infected diabetic foot ulcer but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an X-ray of the foot it'll help with possible osteomyelitis. I'd rather check than guess and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll request blood tests it'll help with infected ulcer. I'd rather check than guess and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
